{"id":"wb-7-899","name":"雷履泰旧居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"雷履泰旧居","text":"雷履泰旧居位于山西省晋中市平遥县城内书院街11号，是日升昌创始人雷履泰的旧居，1994年被列为平遥县文物保护单位，2004年被列为山西省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n旧居始建于清道光年间，是一座典型的平遥传统民居，整座院子坐北向南，由两主院、两跨院组成。主院有南厅、中厅、正房以及两侧厢房。南厅、中厅和厢房均为平房，正房“晋元楼”是两层高的楼房。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9B%B7%E5%B1%A5%E6%B3%B0%E6%97%A7%E5%B1%85","revisionId":92132446,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92132446","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5931643b741cbe50d2b6417d.jpg","title":"Pingyao_Lei_Lütai_Jiuju_2013.08.25_12-16-35.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pingyao_Lei_L%C3%BCtai_Jiuju_2013.08.25_12-16-35.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/Pingyao_Lei_L%C3%BCtai_Jiuju_2013.08.25_12-16-35.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"平遥县雷履泰旧居\n\n南厅临街面及大门","width":320,"height":213}}